  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing Well-being of Internal Migrant Workers in the Electronics Industries in Viet Nam</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In this project, IOM will work closely with a multi-national corporation and their suppliers in the electronics and apparel sectors of Viet Nam, towards the overall objective of promoting upstream responsible supply chain management and future programmes in Viet Nam, with a focus on workers&#x2019; well-being beyond employment conditions.</narrative>
  </description>
